<h1>Support the archive</h1>
<p class="updated">ArtCard.LA is a finished public archive of 1,372 postcards by 746 artists mailed across Los Angeles from 2009–2015. Submissions are closed. It is not an ongoing project: there are no new calls, no memberships, and no programming. The site is maintained as a non-commercial record of Los Angeles mail art.</p>
<p>Donations help cover the domain, hosting, and basic maintenance so the collection and map remain freely available.</p>
<p>One-time and monthly donations are both welcome. Support is handled on Ko-fi.</p>
<p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ site.kofiUrl }}">Support on Ko-fi</a></p>
<p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>.</p>
